ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/IdempotentTraceRigidity.lean#L83-L90","doc":"**Rigidity of trace.** A family of idempotent complex matrices that is continuous on a\npreconnected set has constant trace on that set. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.IdempotentTraceRigidity.rank_const_of_isPreconnected","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.IdempotentTraceRigidity.rank_const_of_isPreconnected","kind":"theorem","line":61,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/IdempotentTraceRigidity.lean#L61-L81","doc":"**Rigidity of rank.** A family of idempotent complex matrices that is continuous on a\npreconnected set has constant rank on that set. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.IdempotentTraceRigidity.trace_eq_rank","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.IdempotentTraceRigidity.trace_eq_rank","kind":"theorem","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/IdempotentTraceRigidity.lean#L42-L48","doc":"The trace of an idempotent matrix over a field equals its rank (cast into the field). ","signatureChunk":0}]}